    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market this stunning four-bedroom mid-terraced red-brick period residence, which has been thoughtfully renovated and extended to the highest of standards throughout. Combining the charm and character of a period home with contemporary design and exceptional attention to detail, this impressive property offers generous, well-proportioned accommodation together with a number of unique features.\n\nA particular highlight is the superb detached studio located to the rear, complete with its own en suite shower room and benefiting from independent pedestrian access onto Millbourne Avenue. This versatile space would be ideal as a home office, studio, guest accommodation or additional living space.\n\nThe main accommodation extends to approximately 119 sq. m. and briefly comprises an entrance hallway leading to a superb open-plan kitchen/dining/living room, creating an impressive and sociable heart to the home. A utility room and shower room are conveniently positioned off the kitchen area.\n\nUpstairs, the first floor provides three well-proportioned bedrooms, an ancillary office/study and a spacious family bathroom. The cleverly converted attic room provides an additional versatile space and benefits from an abundance of natural light through the skylights, together with excellent built-in storage.\n\nOutside, the property continues to impress with the detached rear studio offering exceptional flexibility and the added convenience of its own pedestrian doorway onto Millbourne Avenue.\n\n18 Millmount Avenue is a truly exceptional period home that has been upgraded and extended with great care, resulting in a stylish and highly functional residence. Its generous accommodation, impressive finish, detached studio and superb location make it an ideal choice for those seeking a substantial family home in one of Drumcondra's most sought-after residential locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining, Living Room - \n\n\nUtility Off Living Area - \n\n\nDownstairs Shower Room - \n\n\nLanding - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - \n\n\nBedroom 2 - \n\n\nAncillary Office/Study - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - \n\n\nBathroom - \n\n\nConverted Attic - \n\n\nOutside Studio - \nLaid out as a bedroomEn Suite Shower Room\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Gas fired central heating</li><li> Double glazed uPVC windows</li><li> Excellent rental potential due to the versatile layout and room sizes</li><li> Separate studio with en suite and pedestrian access onto Millbourne Avenue</li><li> Located adjacent to DCU St. Patricks College, just off the Drumcondra Room</ul>"
      },
